      "line": 1533,
      "text": "Network Power-on Clock (From Si5397)"
    },
    {
      "line": 1534,
      "text": "Each QSFP-DD bank is fed by one of the Si5397\u2019s LVPECL coupled clock output signals. The Si5397"
    },
    {
      "line": 1535,
      "text": "outputs 156.25 MHz by default at power-on. The Si5397 can be reprogrammed via I2C from the BMC;"
    },
    {
      "line": 1536,
      "text": "refer to the Si5397 datasheet for details."
    },
    {
